1923:  /// Resolves [to] to a peer agent id: an exact id wins, otherwise the
1924:  /// display name must match exactly one online peer. Ambiguity and
1925:  /// no-match errors list the online peers so the model can retry.
1926:  Future<String> _resolvePeer(String to) async {
1927:    final peers = await _hub.peers();
1928:    final exact = _peerById(peers, to);
1929:    if (exact != null) return to;
1930:    return _resolvePeerName(to, peers);
